# The local design-parity working directory: the materialised reference cache
# (`git archive design-parity/reference` — ~84 MB of kit PNGs) and the per-run
# report.html output. Both are reproducible from the delivery branches, and the
# cache is large enough that one `git add -A` after a local parity run would put
# it in the history for good. See docs/PARITY_LOCAL.md.
.design-parity/
